#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/compress_store.md:127
msgid ""
"First restart the vLLM service to clear all historical caches and ensure "
"the service is in a pure cold start state. After executing the stress "
"test command, no historical KV cache can be reused, and all prefix tokens"
" need to be fully prefilled and calculated."
